    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/traveller-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Traveller Agency theme is a versatile, modern, and fully responsive travel management design created for travel agencies, tourism companies, and booking platforms; featuring a visually engaging and well-structured layout, it is designed to showcase travel packages, honeymoon trips, family vacations, adventure tours, hotel listings, and destination guides in an organized and attractive way that encourages exploration and booking; its flexible architecture supports multiple travel-related purposes including blogs, galleries, tourism promotion, and personal travel storytelling, making it suitable for both agencies and travel content creators; built with powerful customization options, it offers unlimited layout possibilities, shortcodes, and a mega menu system that improves navigation and content presentation; integrated support for eCommerce functionality allows businesses to display and sell travel packages, manage bookings, and promote offers efficiently; custom post types for hotels, places, and galleries make it easy to organize and present detailed travel information in a structured format; fully responsive and mobile-friendly, it ensures smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, providing users with a seamless browsing and booking experience; its clean typography, fresh color palette, and intuitive interface enhance readability and engagement while maintaining a modern aesthetic; combining flexibility, functionality, and travel-focused features, the Traveller Agency theme provides a powerful digital platform for building, managing, and growing a professional travel and tourism business online."
    },
